  "notation": "modern-pedagogical",
  "unitSystem": "si",
  "assumptions": [
    "Each radiation mode in equilibrium carries the classical average energy, Boltzmann's constant times the temperature.",
    "A cutoff frequency; the model counts only frequencies below it.",
    "These are modern teaching equations in SI notation; the paper writes L for c, R/N for Boltzmann's constant, and β for B."
